            "notes": "In the second round we will get a slept on item  [Transference Protocol](item_04d5d433-9493-4094-b4e6-77d632a236e9) this item restores 3% health for each charged orb from volley.  This item with zero attack speed heals you for 21.64hps while charging your volley. So just with the  [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) power and  [Transference Protocol](item_04d5d433-9493-4094-b4e6-77d632a236e9) with no items you get 44.14hps while charging your volley.\n\nAttack speed then increases the speed at which you charge your orbs, so get them instead of weapon damage for now. You will then heal more with  [Transference Protocol](item_04d5d433-9493-4094-b4e6-77d632a236e9). Items like  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) and  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) should do the trick. Sell some greens if needed.\n\nAdditional ability power is not worth it without additional powers for now.",
