            "notes": "We get  [It's Orbin' Time](item_da870e1e-7d1b-4170-b172-1be1485c0c56) for 3 additional orbs, you will heal more, have more orbs charged for kill confirmation. \n\nYou heal so much, that you can play quite close to the front line and abuse third person peaking from cover.\n\nFor items get  [Genji's Galvanic Gloves](item_f633cda1-b736-4071-9221-402af4ac7a43) , this items speeds up your volley charge, increases damage and attack speed by 10% simply the best item you can get.\n\nOn round  with these items your heal per second (hps) is 50. You self heal as if mercy in the base game is constantly healing you. Pretty insane if you ask me.",
