            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-14T10:28:38.017371+00:00",
            "notes": "If you haven't won just yet, it's possibly due to your teammates dying just a bit too much.\nIn round 5 I like to go you with clutch transcendences with the power [Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) and item  [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) \n\nBy using your ultimate with  [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) just using it on your tank you can get thousands of overhealth which dissipates so you have none left after 15 seconds (if you get 1500 overhealth it dissipates at 100 overhealth/s). You can then be very aggressive and get your 100% ultimate charge back very fast.\n\nThis will help you carry your silly suicidal teammates even more. What's very good to know is that you get overhealth from  [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) even when you only heal yourself. So if you are 1 hp, normally 400, and quickly ult and cancel the ult right away you get 399 overhealth and get 75% of the ultimate back. You can see how much ultimate you will have left on your ultimate ticker.\n\nIf you are against a lot of fliers, consider instead getting power  [Seeking Salvation](item_c424d9c0-3a6e-4eb6-b845-cfa284481307), excellent to confirm kills.\n\nIf you struggling against a lot of damage consider getting  [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130), the power will help you restore health even faster.",
