            "notes": "In this round it depends how is causing you to lose the rounds.\n If you lack damage, get more damage items like  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) or  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b).\n\nIf you are missing your volleys get  [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3) \n\nIf you keep dying get more survivability like  [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) , this item will give you 350 overhealth when you are about to die once per life. You will keep healing from your harmony and  [Transference Protocol](item_04d5d433-9493-4094-b4e6-77d632a236e9). \n\nIf your teammates keep dying, good luck..",
